  "details": "On this website we’re on right now to give vrchat feedback if you have a random person’s post pulled up then pull up one of your post right afterwards it shows you can edit someone else’s post I don’t know if it actually allows you to make the changes but the easiness of this glitch is so concerning\nHow to recreate (make sure you have a notification for a comment on one of your post)\n1. Go into any random post\n2. Click your notification button and click a notification that leads to one of your post\n3. Hit edit post\n4. Click the back button to go to the page you were previously on\nIf these steps are followed you will have someone else’s post in your edit field (I didn’t test to see what all you can do to someone else’s post because I don’t want to get in trouble)\n\nOkay so I just tested it gives you an error so you can’t actually change others post all you can do is open them in the edit post section (if it did work I would have did the glitch again and reverted the edit)",
